# Mosaic agent skills

Engineering + productivity skills live in `.cursor/skills/` (upstream [mattpocock/skills](https://github.com/mattpocock/skills), Mosaic overlays in [MOSAIC-CONVENTIONS.md](../skills/MOSAIC-CONVENTIONS.md) and [SOURCE.md](../skills/SOURCE.md)).

## Workflow

`grill-with-docs` → `to-spec` (or `plan-ticket` / `to-prd`) → `to-tickets` / `to-issues` → `implement` (+ `tdd` / `diagnosing-bugs`) → `pr` / `code-review` → **jev smoke test** on user-visible changes.

UI: [ui-prototype-first](./ui-prototype-first.mdc). Deploy: never `firebase deploy` from the agent VM ([AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)).

## Team-lead grilling

During grilling / spec / planning, **answer routine product/design questions yourself** (docs, ADRs, PRD, `CONTEXT.md`); log decisions on the ticket/spec. **Escalate** only billing, app-store publish, prod data migration/destruction, or strategy forks → `## Open decisions` on PR/spec.

## Jira

Project `MS`, Atlassian MCP. Agents **never** transition tickets to **Done**; stop at **In Review**. Merge PRs on **green CI** (do not wait for Jonathan to merge).

Tracker detail: [docs/agents/issue-tracker.md](../../docs/agents/issue-tracker.md).
